# Sign off
@scenario office_lesson_30
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk wave]
pip: One final rehearsal. Make a choice change state, change a pose, and light the last beat before signing off.
pip: Build your own three-beat VNS scene and play both routes in the runtime. Use the package tools to give a friend a build.
@label check
pip: When is this rehearsal ready to share?
> The first frame looks right in the editor. -> retry
> Both routes work from a fresh start in the exported build. -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: A finished rehearsal checks the route, the rendered result and the installed experience. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: A finished rehearsal checks the route, the rendered result and the installed experience.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_30]
[flag tutorial_done_30]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_6]
